Subject: [PATCH] ti-core-initramfs: drop ';' from IMAGE_PREPROCESS_COMMAND

IMAGE_PREPROCESS_COMMAND is a space-separated list of functions, so the
trailing ';' makes image.bbclass warn and keeps deploy_verity_hash out
of the task signature. Changes to it then do not trigger a rebuild.

AI-Generated: Uses Claude Code (Claude Opus 5.5)
Signed-off-by: Tim Orling <tim.orling@konsulko.com>
